Dear All,

Shepherd by WANCLOUDS Inc., is a Mandatory Access (Selinux) & Compliance
Controller (MACC) designed for containers and Linux hosts (RHEL, Centos,
Fedora....Oracle Linux atm) at scale.

Shepherd is an agent-less platform with no daemon installed on the
monitored nodes. A user is able to configure, deploy and manage multiple
(SELinux) security policies at the controller level and apply it to the
clustered nodes/VMs running Kubernetes, Docker Swarm, or Docker Engine.

Shepherd follows Restful APIs to orchestrate, enforce, and monitor policies
for containers across any private/public cloud or data center.

One can register at https://trial.shepherd.one/login and get comfortable
with the all Shepherd's features by using its SandBox env.

Thoughts/critical comments are welcome.

Thank You all.

